</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"44sf7m" data-start=3D"314" data-end=3D"350">
<p data-start=3D"316" data-end=3D"350">Import your <strong data-start=3D"32=
8" data-end=3D"339">DevRann</strong> repository</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"1wjfcwl" data-start=3D"352" data-end=3D"373">Step 3:=
 Configure</h3>
<p data-start=3D"374" data-end=3D"426">Vercel will automatically detect it'=
s a Next.js app.</p>
<p data-start=3D"428" data-end=3D"470">Usually you don't need to change any=
thing.</p>
<p data-start=3D"472" data-end=3D"543">If you use environment variables (Fi=
rebase keys, etc.), add them under:</p>
<p data-start=3D"545" data-end=3D"591"><strong data-start=3D"545" data-end=
=3D"591">Project =E2=86=92 Settings =E2=86=92 Environment Variables</strong=
></p>
<p data-start=3D"593" data-end=3D"676">Copy everything from your local <cod=
e data-start=3D"625" data-end=3D"637">.env.local</code> except secrets you =
don't want exposed.</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"1myass1" data-start=3D"678" data-end=3D"696">Step 4:=
 Deploy</h3>
<p data-start=3D"697" data-end=3D"714">Click <strong data-start=3D"703" dat=
a-end=3D"713">Deploy</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"716" data-end=3D"756">After 1=E2=80=933 minutes you'll get=
 a URL like:</p>
<pre class=3D"overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start=3D"758" data-end=3D"792">=
<div class=3D"relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=3D""><div class=3D"cont=
