<p data-start=3D"794" data-end=3D"855">Every future <code data-start=3D"807=
" data-end=3D"817">git push</code> automatically redeploys your website.</p=
>
<hr data-start=3D"857" data-end=3D"860">
<h3 data-section-id=3D"4azqwh" data-start=3D"862" data-end=3D"894">Before d=
eploying, make sure:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"895" data-end=3D"1096">
<li data-section-id=3D"1jbpr15" data-start=3D"895" data-end=3D"944">
<p data-start=3D"897" data-end=3D"944">=E2=9C=85 Project builds successfull=
y (<code data-start=3D"928" data-end=3D"943">npm run build</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1rfd8b3" data-start=3D"945" data-end=3D"976">
<p data-start=3D"947" data-end=3D"976">=E2=9C=85 No hardcoded localhost URL=
s</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"4cc8lw" data-start=3D"977" data-end=3D"1014">
<p data-start=3D"979" data-end=3D"1014">=E2=9C=85 Firebase configuration is=
 correct</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"18fbq5z" data-start=3D"1015" data-end=3D"1060">
<p data-start=3D"1017" data-end=3D"1060">=E2=9C=85 Environment variables ar=
e added in Vercel</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1ttqvyk" data-start=3D"1061" data-end=3D"1096">
<p data-start=3D"1063" data-end=3D"1096">=E2=9C=85 <code data-start=3D"1065=
" data-end=3D"1077">.env.local</code> is in <code data-start=3D"1084" data-=
end=3D"1096">.gitignore</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
