<blockquote data-start=3D"275" data-end=3D"582">
<p data-start=3D"277" data-end=3D"582">Use <code data-start=3D"281" data-en=
d=3D"299">/public/logo.png</code> as the official DevRann logo. Replace eve=
ry instance of the old CodezArena branding (logo, favicon, navbar, loading =
screen, login page, SEO image, app icons, and Open Graph image) with this l=
ogo. Remove all CodezArena branding and make DevRann the only brand through=
out the project.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"584" data-end=3D"587">
<h3 data-section-id=3D"18r521b" data-start=3D"589" data-end=3D"635">Option =
2: Upload the logo into the AI chat</h3>
<p data-start=3D"636" data-end=3D"716">If OpenCode supports image uploads, =
simply drag the image into the chat and say:</p>
