<p data-start=3D"948" data-end=3D"1240">Use <code data-start=3D"952" data-e=
nd=3D"970">/public/logo.png</code> as the official DevRann logo. Replace ev=
ery CodezArena logo, favicon, loading screen, navbar logo, login logo, SEO/=
Open Graph image, browser title, and any remaining CodezArena branding with=
 this asset. Ensure DevRann is the only brand shown throughout the applicat=
ion.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"1242" data-end=3D"1522" data-is-last-node=3D"" data-is-onl=
y-node=3D"">One suggestion about your logo: the Viking helmet with the <cod=
e data-start=3D"1301" data-end=3D"1306">&lt;/&gt;</code> symbol is memorabl=
e and fits a coding arena theme. For better visibility in a dark UI, consid=
er also creating a version with a transparent background (PNG or SVG) so it=
