<h3 data-section-id=3D"39q14k" data-start=3D"46" data-end=3D"87">Method 1: =
Drag and Drop (Recommended)</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"89" data-end=3D"415">
<li data-section-id=3D"bf5610" data-start=3D"89" data-end=3D"137">
<p data-start=3D"92" data-end=3D"137">Save the logo to your computer as <co=
de data-start=3D"126" data-end=3D"136">logo.png</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1kwxyjs" data-start=3D"138" data-end=3D"170">
<p data-start=3D"141" data-end=3D"170">Open your project in VS Code.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"z98sih" data-start=3D"171" data-end=3D"302">
