rose"] *)) { color: var(--tw-prose-bold); font-weight: 600; }
  .prose :where(a strong):not(:where([class~=3D"not-prose"], [class~=3D"not=
-prose"] *)), .prose :where(blockquote strong):not(:where([class~=3D"not-pr=
